              "oldText": "IBM reserves the right to investigate potential violations of the representations and warranties in Subsection 11.2(b).",
              "newText": "IBM reserves the right to investigate potential violations of the representations and warranties in Subsection 11.2(b), provided that any such investigation will be conducted no more than once in any twelve (12) month period, upon at least fifteen (15) days' prior written notice to Customer, during normal business hours, by an independent investigator bound by written obligations of confidentiality, at IBM's cost unless the investigation reveals an underpayment by Customer exceeding ten percent (10%) of amounts due, and without direct or remote access to Customer's systems or Customer Components."
